      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "DIMORA BIG BOY (3) charged out of the boxes with a slick early split and went straight to the front, giving a huge sight but headed late when a 0.8 lengths second (22.28) over 390m at this track. Still to record a win from this draw but has never missed the frame in two starts. Must come into calculations. PAW YURI (1) jumped from out wide and was game in defeat last start when a 1.75 lengths third (22.60) behind Zipping Lilo at this track. Expected to be in this for a long way. MAJOR WAIT (2) was below best last time but prior to that was narrowly beaten when fifth (17.18) in a Rank Limit - Grade 5 at Healesville. Expected to bounce back to best. FRED'S FURY (6) has strong credentials over this journey.",
